  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Accelerating Clean Energy to Reduce Inequality (ACCESS) project - Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Accelerating Clean Energy to Reduce Inequality (ACCESS) project is to support the poor and the most vulnerable communities to have equitable and sustainable access to basic service for improving their livelihoods. The Accelerating Clean Energy project will implement activities that will produce following outputs.Output 1: Renewable based power plants built providing sustainable access to electricity for remote villagers. Output 2: Water pumps and highly efficient solar Lamp</narrative>
  </description>
